{"branch":"원흥점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">원흥점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-76dc43db676de56c.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"원흥점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-76dc43db676de56c.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 고양시 덕양구 권율대로 672 원흥역봄오피스텔 217호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 3호선</span><span>원흥역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>원흥역2번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>원흥역3번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>원흥역8번출구.방송통신대앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>원흥역1번출구.방송통신대</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>원흥역7번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>원흥역4번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>원흥역6번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>원흥역5번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>원흥동</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>원흥동</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>313</span><span>313-1</span><span>567</span><span>730</span><span>95</span><span>N999</span><span>999</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>024A</span><span>024B</span><span>043</span><span>043(원당역)</span><span>046